msgstr "Számla fizetési határideje"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-invoice.php:45
msgid "days"
msgstr "nap"

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-invoice.php:49
msgid ""
"The due date, in number of days. Leave 0 if you do not want to display the "
"due date on the invoice."
msgstr "A határidő napokban. Ha nem szeretnéd megjeleníteni a fizetési határidőt a számlán, hagyd 0‑n."

#: includes/base/admin/settings/views/view-payment-settings-invoice.php:56
